# TanStack Router's route tree, generated by apps/web's `routes` script (and
# by `vite dev` and `vite build`). Never committed: the web's route issues
# run in parallel and would conflict on it. The web's `dist/` and `.wrangler/`
# and the examples' `node_modules/` fall under the patterns above.
apps/web/src/routeTree.gen.ts

# The build's spec and issues name local paths and the private plan, so they
# stay out of the public repo (W8 899 asks the user before H3 whether to publish
# a scrubbed copy). A worktree holds only tracked files, so every agent reads
# them by absolute path in the main checkout.
.scratch/build/
